  "reason": "Ms. Franklin's request for upper eyelid blepharoplasty (CPT 15823) meets all functional/reconstructive criteria under policy MP-COS-001: documented superior visual field deficit of 28 degrees (Criterion 1), 16-degree improvement with lid elevation confirming lid-attributable cause (Criterion 2), margin-to-reflex distance of 1.5 mm (Criterion 3), and documented functional impairment with reading/driving difficulty and compensatory brow strain/headache (Criterion 4). Because the procedure is medically necessary rather than purely cosmetic, it is not subject to the plan's cosmetic exclusion. Member eligibility, provider network status, diagnosis-procedure match, and benefit accumulator balance are all in order, and no existing authorization conflicts with this request.",
